        <field name="slide_category">article</field>
        <field name="sequence">22</field>
        <field name="html_content" type="html"><div class="oe-course-content"><p><span class="oe-path">CRM › Sales › My Pipeline</span> shows every opportunity as a card, in columns from <strong>New</strong> to <strong>Won</strong>. Drag a card to the next column as it moves on. Each column totals the expected revenue.</p><div class="oe-diagram"><img src="/business_elearning/static/img/pipeline.png" alt="The CRM pipeline with opportunities in four columns" class="img-fluid" /><p class="oe-diagram-caption"><span class="oe-diagram-caption-tag">Screenshot</span>the pipeline: six opportunities from New to Proposition.</p></div><p>Requests from your website's <span class="oe-path">Contact us</span> form arrive here as new leads. The clock on a card is its next activity: schedule a call or a to-do so nothing goes quiet, and it shows on your My Day when it's due.</p></div></field>
